{"id":"cadee7248274622b","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-exact-work-space-construction.md","title":"Fully Space-Constructible Function","display":"df-space-constructible-function — Fully Space-Constructible Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-exact-work-space-construction","aliases":["73-df-exact-work-space-construction","73-df-space-constructible-function"],"display":"df-space-constructible-function — Fully Space-Constructible Function","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","[[73-df-deterministic-work-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-exact-work-space-construction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-exact-work-space-construction</span><span>73-df-space-constructible-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-space-constructible-function — Fully Space-Constructible Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1a769cdc24b3e236\" href=\"?note=1a769cdc24b3e236\" title=\"73-df-deterministic-work-space\">73-df-deterministic-work-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span> (candidate space bound)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{1\\}\">\\(\\{1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1^n\">\\(1^n\\)</span> (unary alphabet and word power, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WorkMDTM}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{WorkMDTM}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ReadOnlyInput}\">\\(\\operatorname{ReadOnlyInput}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{InputHeadBounded}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{InputHeadBounded}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{space}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{space}_M\\)</span> (work-tape model and usage, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1a769cdc24b3e236\" href=\"?note=1a769cdc24b3e236\" title=\"73-df-deterministic-work-space\">73-df-deterministic-work-space</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}space\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{SpaceConstructible}(s)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists M\\in\\{T:\\operatorname{WorkMDTM}_{\\{1\\}}(T)\\}\\;\\Bigl[\\operatorname{WorkMDTM}_{\\{1\\}}(M)\\land\\operatorname{ReadOnlyInput}(M)\n\\land\\operatorname{InputHeadBounded}_{\\{1\\}}(M)\n\\land(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{space}_M(1^n)\\downarrow=s(n))\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}space\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{SpaceConstructible}(s)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists M\\in\\{T:\\operatorname{WorkMDTM}_{\\{1\\}}(T)\\}\\;\\Bigl[\\operatorname{WorkMDTM}_{\\{1\\}}(M)\\land\\operatorname{ReadOnlyInput}(M)\n\\land\\operatorname{InputHeadBounded}_{\\{1\\}}(M)\n\\land(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{space}_M(1^n)\\downarrow=s(n))\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>空间代价计入工作带上实际访问过的不同格子，包含初始读头所在格；它不是写入非空白字符的格数。输入读头限制仍保留原模型只检查停机运行的定义。</p>\n<p>精确可构造性对包括空输入在内的每个长度都要求恰好达到给定空间值，不把渐近等价的函数自动视为同一个精确空间函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-deterministic-work-space","status":"resolved","id":"1a769cdc24b3e236","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-deterministic-work-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\{1\\}$ and $1^n$ (unary alphabet and word power, see [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-deterministic-work-space","status":"resolved","id":"1a769cdc24b3e236","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{WorkMDTM}_{\\Sigma}$, $\\operatorname{ReadOnlyInput}$, $\\operatorname{InputHeadBounded}_{\\Sigma}$, and $\\operatorname{space}_M$ (work-tape model and usage, see [[73-df-deterministic-work-space]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"1^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WorkMDTM}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ReadOnlyInput}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{InputHeadBounded}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{space}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}space\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{SpaceConstructible}(s)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists M\\in\\{T:\\operatorname{WorkMDTM}_{\\{1\\}}(T)\\}\\;\\Bigl[\\operatorname{WorkMDTM}_{\\{1\\}}(M)\\land\\operatorname{ReadOnlyInput}(M)\n\\land\\operatorname{InputHeadBounded}_{\\{1\\}}(M)\n\\land(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{space}_M(1^n)\\downarrow=s(n))\\Bigr]","display":true}],"bytes":1648,"backlinks":[{"id":"8346a921772e7ddf","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SpaceConstr}$ 见 [[73-df-exact-work-space-construction]]；$\\mathsf{NSPACE},\\mathsf{coNSPACE}$ 的全部约束见 [[73-df-nondeterministic-work-space]]。$\\mathrm{SPACE}(S(n))$ 是以整个函数 $S$ 为参数的兼容写法。"},{"id":"4f6c74e9e6793301","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b97e57a60826afa3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"708dbbb6cfe69b79","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SpaceConstructible}$ (full space constructibility, see [[73-df-exact-work-space-construction]])"}],"outgoing":["0a6da8c909717780","1a769cdc24b3e236"]}